    "name": "Example Dashboard - Version 6.0.0",
    "description": "The v6.0.0 Rita stage: a small board Rita can see and rearrange for you. Set the Rita URL and turn on Context sharing in AI Library \u25b8 Agents so Rita can see these cards, then ask it to work the board \u2014 \"add a note summarising the day\", \"rename this dashboard to Markets\", \"move the clock to the top\", \"add a markdown widget\". Every widget is a built-in, so no backend is needed.",
    "img": "/openbq/bdobb-logo.svg",
