            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "w": 40,
            "h": 10,
            "state": {
              "params": {
                "text": "# Rita can work this board\n\nWith **Context Sharing** on (AI Library \u25b8 Agents), Rita sees every card here and can author the dashboard for you. Try asking it to:\n\n- **Add a note** \u2014 \"add a note summarising today's session\" (Rita writes a markdown card).\n- **Rename** \u2014 \"rename this dashboard to Markets\", or \"call the clock card World Clock\".\n- **Rearrange** \u2014 \"move the clock to the top\", \"make this note full width\".\n- **Add a tab** \u2014 \"add a Rates tab\".\n- **Add a widget** \u2014 \"add a clock\" (Rita finds it with search_widgets, then adds it).\n\nRita only sees the board while Context Sharing is on, and never sees a Keys widget. Everything it does is one **Undo** away."
              }
            }
          },
